+4. Enqueue a slow streaming reply with many single-character chunks so the streaming window is wide enough to observe (use a long text split into 1-character chunks). For example, split the string `"This is a long streaming response from the AI assistant that verifies the active state of the console while the model is generating text."` into individual characters, each as its own chunk.
